Q1) a) In a thermal oxide of thickness 0.50 nm is grown on a silicon wafer using either wet or dry oxidation, what thickness
       of the substrate is consumed ?
    b) Does the thickness and growth rate depend on crystal orientation (i.e., will thickness differ on [100] and [111] wafers) ?
Sol:a) XOX = 500 nm
     Thickness of the substrate consumed = 0.46 × XOX
                                         = 0.46 × 500 nm
                                         = 230 nm
    b) Thickness: No, growth rate: yes
